<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher on Tuesday in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 581.64, up 1.91.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 276 to 250.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.04.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 23,531,755, compared with 20,200,870 Monday.</p>
<p>	    (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
